# .git is deliberately included: hatch-vcs derives the version from the tag
# during the build (see assistant/hatch_build.py). It never reaches the
# runtime image — only the builder stage sees it.
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
ui/dist
# assistant/test stays in the context on purpose: it is tracked in git, and
# leaving it out makes the work tree read as dirty during the build, which
# turns a tagged release into a .devN version. It never leaves the builder stage.
